OL,3,GNEWSALong tailbacks on M42 after fatal
OL,4,Acollision
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong tailbacks and heavy congestion
OL,7,Fhave been reported around the M42 in
OL,8,FWorcestershire after the westbound
OL,9,Fcarriageway was closed overnight.
OL,11,FWest Mercia Police was called to the
OL,12,Fmotorway near Redditch at 22:15 BST on
OL,13,FThursday after a pedestrian suffered
OL,14,Ffatal injuries in a collision with a
OL,15,Fsilver Vauxhall Insignia.
OL,17,FThe westbound carriageway remains
OL,18,Fclosed between junctions three and two
OL,19,Fand is expected to stay shut for
OL,20,Fseveral hours, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
