OL,3,GNEWSALong tailbacks on M42 after fatal
OL,4,Acollision
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways said there were
OL,7,Fdelays of about 30 minutes, with queues
OL,8,Fstretching for three miles. Inquiries
OL,9,Fto confirm the pedestrian's identity
OL,10,Fare under way.
